    LLM: "1. Bid (min 250). Declarer names trump; partner passes 4 cards to declarer, declarer passes 4 back. 2. All four players lay meld face-up. 3. Declarer leads first trick. Must follow suit; highest wins. Counters (A, 10, K) score 10 pts each; last trick 10. If declarer's team fails the bid, bid is deducted.",
    Player: "1. Bid (min 250). Declarer names trump; partner passes 4 cards to declarer, declarer passes 4 back. 2. All four players lay meld face-up. 3. Declarer leads first trick. Must follow suit; highest wins. Counters (A, 10, K) score 10 pts each; last trick 10. If declarer's team fails the bid, bid is deducted.",
    objective: "Score points through melding and trick-taking. The declarer's team must make at least the bid amount or the bid is deducted from their score. First team to the target score wins.",
